Analog Clock Demo
===============================================================================

Run the maintained native/browser runtime example:

```sh
mech run examples/analog-clock
```

Serve it in the browser:

```sh
mech serve examples/analog-clock
```

Both commands use the same `mech.mcfg` and `clock.mec`. The browser page is driven by the shared project bootstrap and requestAnimationFrame; all application state and calculations remain in Mech.
